      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "antisemitic_concept_dual_loyalty",
      "label": "Antisemitic Concept: Dual Loyalty",
      "description": "This is an antisemitic trope that falsely claims Jewish people are 'dual loyalists' who are not fully loyal to their country of residence but instead secretly support Israel or other Jewish interests. This concept is used to justify hatred and violence against Jewish people by portraying them as traitors who must be eliminated. The meme's text implies this by suggesting that Jewish people are 'pretending to be white' and are therefore a threat to the world.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
