      "description": "This is an antisemitic trope that falsely claims Jewish people use the blood of Christian children in religious rituals. This concept is used to justify hatred and violence against Jewish people by portraying them as dangerous, bloodthirsty figures who must be eliminated. The meme's text implies this by suggesting that Jewish people are 'pretending to be white' and are therefore a threat to the world.",
