    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8e4856cc",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "threatening_intimidation",
      "label": "threatening and intimidating emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is one of overt threat and intimidation, conveyed through both the visual of the dog staring intensely and the explicit, violent text. The dog's confrontational gaze, combined with the text's declaration of possessing nuclear weapons and threatening to 'wipe Israel off the fucking map,' creates a powerful and menacing emotional atmosphere designed to instill fear and provoke aggression.",
