      "description": "The meme explicitly threatens violence against Jewish people and the State of Israel, using hyperbolic and violent language ('72 nukes', 'wipe Israel off the fucking map') to intimidate and incite fear. This constitutes direct abuse targeting a specific community.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_f6744fe4"
